# Redirects for https://hangar.page/, read by the docs Worker from the root of
# the gh-pages branch, where scripts/docs-root-files.sh copies this file.
#
# mike publishes each version in its own directory (/dev/, /1.0/, /latest/),
# and mike's index.html sends the root to /latest/. MkDocs builds each
# version's 404.html with links from the site root and no version, such as
# /assets/... and /get-started/, and the Worker serves that 404.html for any missing
# page under the version. These rules send such paths, and links that leave
# out the version, to the latest version. Every top-level section of docs/
# needs a line (deploy/cloudflare_test.go TestDocsRedirectsCoverEverySection).
#
# scripts/docs-root-files.sh adds two rules after these on gh-pages, which
# send the version directory that /latest/ links to, such as /1.4/, to
# /latest/, so each page of the current docs has one address.
/assets/*        /latest/assets/:splat        200
/search/*        /latest/search/:splat        200
/benchmarks/*    /latest/benchmarks/:splat    301
/concepts/*      /latest/concepts/:splat      301
/faq/*           /latest/faq/:splat           301
/get-started/*   /latest/get-started/:splat   301
/guides/*        /latest/guides/:splat        301
/operate/*       /latest/operate/:splat       301
/project/*       /latest/project/:splat       301
/reference/*     /latest/reference/:splat     301
/security/*      /latest/security/:splat      301
